    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•\tLovely 2-bedroom 2 bath own door duplex apartment\r\n•\tPermit car parking\r\n•\tApprox. 80 sq m / 861 sq ft in size\r\n•\tConvenient and sought-after location\r\n•\tWell-maintained development with mature communal gardens\r\n\r\nJim Gallagher of Corry Estates is thrilled to present 74 Ivy Court to the market for sale. This is a fantastic 2 bed 2 bath duplex apartment situated in this sought after location. This excellent property benefits from own door access, a private decked terrace, and resident’s permit parking.\r\n\r\nLocated in the sought-after and well-maintained development of Beaumont Woods, 74 Ivy Court is a well laid out home extending to approx. 80 sq m / 861 sq ft over 2 floors. The property comprises in brief of a hall, and an open plan kitchen, living, and dining room at entrance level. While upstairs there are 2 bedrooms, an en suite shower room, and a bathroom. \r\n\r\nPerfectly located within a mature residential area, the property is within close proximity to all local services and amenities such as Artane Castle Shopping Centre, Omni Shopping Centre and cinema, Beaumont Hospital, local shops, schools, DCU, and numerous leisure facilities. Dublin City Centre is easily accessible via a superb bus service along the Beaumont Road with the number 14 and 104 buses running frequently from the entrance to the development. Dublin Airport, the M50, and the M1 are only a short drive, opening up the wider city and further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall:\r\nWelcoming carpeted hallway with access to the kitchen, living room, and staircase\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\nLocated to front of the property, this is a large bright room complete with tiled floor and splashback, built-in kitchen units providing ample storage, and integrated oven, hob, and extractor fan. Open plan and leading directly into the dining and living room areas\r\n\r\nDining / Living Room:\r\nLarge bright open plan room, with laminate wooden flooring running throughout creating a sense of continuity. The dining area leads directly onto the private decked terrace, and the living room area is a large room perfect for entertaining\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\nLarge double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, and en suite shower room\r\n\r\nEn Suite:\r\nFully tiled shower room with W.C., wash hand basin, and shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nLarge double bedroom with built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\nFully tiled room, complete with bath with shower attachment, W.C., and wash hand basin\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nPrivate decked terrace which is not overlooked"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Private decked terrace\r\nPermit car parking\r\nElectric heating\r\nWell-maintained mature communal gardens"
      },
